            "text": "<p>Orders are generally processed within <strong>1–3 business days</strong> after the order is successfully placed.</p><p>Orders placed on weekends or public holidays will generally be processed on the next business day.</p><p>Processing time may be longer during:</p><ul><li>Sales and promotional periods</li><li>Holidays</li><li>High-volume order periods</li><li>Unexpected operational circumstances</li></ul><p>Once your order has been shipped, you will receive a shipping confirmation with tracking information where available.</p>"
